msgid ""
"<p>Please enter the desired subnetmask for the interface here.</p>\n"
"<p>For small private networks, 255.255.255.0 will most often be a reasonable "
"default value.</p>\n"
"<p>This field will change from a popup box to a combo box as soon as you "
"enable the advanced settings below.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>請在此輸入界面要用的子網絡遮罩。</p>\n"
"<p>對於小型的私人網絡， 255.255.255.0 會是很合理的預設值。</p>\n"
"<p>如你啟用下面的進階設置，此欄位會由彈出式選單變成組合式選單。</p>"

